Welcome to my first project as Data Engineer

🚀 Project 1 — E-Commerce Daily Data Pipeline & Analytics Platform
🎯 Business Scenario

This is my first end-to-end Data Engineering project.

The business scenario is an e-commerce company that receives transactional data every day from its operational systems. Instead of directly using these files for reporting, the Data Engineering team is responsible for building a reliable pipeline that ingests, validates, transforms, and loads the data into an analytics-ready environment.

The goal is to support business reporting such as:

Daily Revenue
Total Orders
Completed Orders
Cancelled Orders
Average Order Value (AOV)
Top-Selling Products
Top-Selling Categories
Customer Purchasing Trends
🎯 Project Goal

Hindi lang gumawa ng Python script.

The real goal is to simulate how a real Data Engineering team builds a production-ready ETL pipeline.

Instead of focusing on dashboards first, the priority is making sure that the data is complete, validated, and trusted before it reaches the analytics layer.

What I Learned Before Writing Any Code

Isa sa pinakamalaking realization ko bago pa kami magsimula mag-code is that Data Engineering is more about designing the flow of data than writing Python.

Before this project, akala ko enough na ang magkaroon ng database at tables.

Pero sa real-world production, may iba't ibang layers pala ang data.

