Purpose of Every Schema
Raw

Ito ang unang destination ng lahat ng incoming files.

No validation.

No transformation.

Store the data exactly as it was received.

Parang evidence room.

Ayaw muna naming baguhin ang original data.

Staging

Dito magsisimula ang actual Data Engineering work.

Examples:

Validate data
Clean invalid records
Standardize values
Remove duplicates
Apply business rules
Warehouse

This layer contains trusted and business-ready data.

Ito na ang magiging source ng dashboards at reports.

Analytics

This layer contains business metrics, KPIs, and reporting tables.

Ito na ang directly ginagamit ng management.

