My Biggest Realization About Metadata

At first, akala ko unnecessary lang sila.

Pero habang ginagawa namin yung pipeline, na-realize ko na hindi sila business data.

They are operational metadata.

These fields help Data Engineers answer questions like:

Saan nanggaling ang data?
Kailan ito na-process?
Anong pipeline execution ang nag-load nito?

Business Time is not equal to Pipeline Time.

Example:

created_at

Business Event

↓

ingested_at

Pipeline Processing Time

