Biggest Mindset Shift

Before this project, I thought Data Engineering was mostly about Python.

After building the Raw Layer, I realized that Python is only a tool.

The real responsibility of a Data Engineer is making sure that data moves through the pipeline correctly, consistently, and reliably.

Hindi pala enough na "gumagana."

Kailangan maintindihan kung bakit ganito ang design ng pipeline.

